  "policies": {
    "twilight": "Real pre-activation branches set other active minions Attack or Health; existing Choose Both uses one combined stat-set body. Options remain nonphysical zero-cost descriptors with full raw6 retained.",
    "chronogor": "Draw two highest current stored Cost cards from own deck, then the opponent draws two lowest from that same deck, fresh per draw. Tie selection is uniform; an empty matching pool skips. Actual cross-deck draws preserve physical cards, recipient draw events, overflow and drawn-spell replacement from the recipient own deck.",
    "chromie": "At actual Deathrattle execution, freeze distinct submitted card IDs from all own hand-play records in first-play order. Draw one random matching physical card per ID; repeated plays do not increase that identity budget. No creation and no automatic-cast credit. Identity, order, multiplicity and counter remain CN-pending.",
    "epoch": "Latest closed opponent owner interval; successful ordinary paid minion entry only. Join immutable hand-play and successful-summon records to original board residence; exclude copies, summons and countered/magnetized entries. Destroy the surviving original residences as one normal batch.",
    "esho": "Current deck Minion tribes have a common member, using the existing complete TribeState and all-tribe exclusions; empty Minion collection is vacuously true. Buff other existing active board/HAND/DECK minions once using the public cross-zone scope, not future entities."
  },
